---
description: Review the actor-scoped observations of an Adventure journey.
args:
  review: AdventureCheck
returns: ExampleReview
---
For review.kind access call inspectAccess with review.check and review.current. For continuity call compareJourney with review.check, review.before and review.after. For artwork call compareIllustration with review.current and review.artwork. Return the child report unchanged.
